ices and two dining areas.","source_url":"https://www.sacredheart.edu/sacred-heart-life/life-on-campus/linda-e-mcmahon-student-commons/","source_title":"Linda E. McMahon Student Commons | Sacred Heart University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A student-oriented building; dining and bookstore purchases are separate.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"shu-pioneer-pavilion","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Pioneer Pavilion","title":"Pause at Pioneer Pavilion","subtitle":"Fifth stop · Welcome Weekend gathering point","notes":"Use the pavilion as a simple outdoor rendezvous point and look for officially scheduled welcome or student-life programming nearby.","short_summary":"A named outdoor gathering location used in Welcome Weekend programming.","evidence_claim":"Sacred Heart's Welcome Weekend schedule lists Pioneer Pavilion as the location for Big Red Welcome activities.","source_url":"https://www.sacredheart.edu/sacred-heart-life/student-events--activities/orientation-programs--first-year-experience/welcome-weekend/schedule/","source_title":"Welcome Weekend Schedule | Sacred Heart University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Programming changes by term; confirm current events through SHU Engage or Student Involvement.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"shu-shu-engage-club-search","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"SHU Engage Club Search","title":"Pick one interest to explore on SHU Engage","subtitle":"Sixth stop · Any campus location","notes":"Search one interest, open a club page for its meeting details, and join only if the group feels like a fit for you.","short_summary":"The official route for finding clubs, events and meeting information.",