ion link and arrive early enough to choose shoes, a ball and a lane safely.","short_summary":"A six-lane bowling center inside the Recreation Center.","evidence_claim":"Pioneer Lanes is a 5,000-square-foot, six-lane bowling center for open recreation, events and leagues.","source_url":"https://www.sacredheart.edu/sacred-heart-life/fitness-recreation--sports/valentine-health--recreation-center/","source_title":"Valentine Health & Recreation Center | Sacred Heart University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Current listed hours are 5–11 p.m. weekdays and 1–11 p.m. weekends; reserve through the University link.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"shu-william-pitt-athletic-convocation-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"William Pitt Athletic & Convocation Center","title":"Check the Pitt Center event calendar","subtitle":"Ninth stop · Park Avenue Campus","notes":"See whether a home competition or campus event fits your weekend, then confirm the event’s entry terms before heading over.","short_summary":"A Division I competition venue and campus-wide event space.","evidence_claim":"Sacred Heart describes the William Pitt Athletic & Convocation Center as a Division I competition venue and campus-wide event space.","source_url":"https://www.sacredheart.edu/offices--departments-directory/athletics/","source_title":"Athletics | Sacred Heart University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Events and admission conditions vary; use the official athletics schedule or event listing before attending.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"shu-martire-family-arena","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Martire Family Arena","title":"End with a West Campus arena pl